msgid "CloudDrive2"
msgstr "CloudDrive2"

msgid "CloudDrive2 runs as a native binary; this is not a Docker deployment."
msgstr "本插件以原生二进制方式运行，并非 Docker 容器。"

msgid "Configure ports, account credentials, mount points and other options in the CloudDrive2 web interface."
msgstr "端口、账号密码、挂载点及其他选项，请前往 CloudDrive2 Web 后台设置。"

msgid "The default HTTP port is 19798. The configured port is checked automatically before the service starts; a conflict prevents startup and is written to the system log."
msgstr "默认 HTTP 端口为 19798。服务启动前会自动检查实际配置端口是否被占用；如有冲突则停止启动并写入系统日志。"

msgid "We recommend mounting cloud drives under /mnt and using the Samba4 package for network sharing."
msgstr "建议将云盘挂载到 /mnt 目录下，并搭配 Samba4 插件进行网络共享，使用体验更佳。"

